    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch01-07: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.91";
    dc:description "Existence of computationally universal systems with extremely compact rules is checkable through explicit constructions and proofs, including rule 110. Only the rhetorical rule-length wording requires mild interpretation.";
