    dc:type "resolution-route/proof";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Specify a one-sentence rule system and verify a published construction that simulates a known universal machine with an effective encoding. A valid simulation proof confirms existence; a universal impossibility theorem over the defined rule class would refute it.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "The informal length measure one sentence is language-dependent.";
